; pre.script: the virtiorng bench's pass on the Kickstart build (boot from
; kickstart_virtiorng.zip with two cards). rngread's 9 checks on each unit,
; then a 60 s torture (8 tasks, two rounds) on each unit in turn.
;   Execute SHARED:rbench/pre.script
FailAt 30
Copy SHARED:rbench/rngread RAM: QUIET
Protect RAM:rngread +rwed QUIET
RAM:rngread 1024 0 >RAM:r-u0.txt
RAM:rngread 1024 1 >RAM:r-u1.txt
RAM:rngread TORTURE 60 0 8 >RAM:r-t0.txt
RAM:rngread TORTURE 60 1 8 >RAM:r-t1.txt
Copy RAM:r-#?.txt SHARED:rbench/out/ QUIET
Echo "== totals"
Search RAM:r-u0.txt RAM:r-u1.txt "tests passed" NONUM
Search RAM:r-t0.txt RAM:r-t1.txt "torture:" NONUM
Echo "== failures"
Search RAM:r-u0.txt RAM:r-u1.txt RAM:r-t0.txt RAM:r-t1.txt "FAIL" NONUM
